<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Kolɔse</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi É Teʋeni Kolɔse Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kolɔse</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kolɔse Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔle ɠa é sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛni Kolɔse nuiti ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). É sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la kasoi ɠa, kona ʋuulɔzita (60) ɠɛɠala leʋegai ma, Kilista zɔlɔɔgai ʋoluma. Kolɔse nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi, ta Efɛze nuiti tɔnɔi, ta Filipe nuiti tɔnɔi, naa ʋɛɛ Filemɔn nɔnɔi ʋa, ti-laasei pɛɛʋɛ ga kasoɠa zɛʋɛiti, tɔɔzei é ti zɛʋɛni siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la kasoi ɠa. É sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛni Egilisii ma, é Kolɔse taa wolai zu. Pɔle lɛi é ʋa ɠɛni Kolɔse Egilisii laaɠulani (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:1">2:1</ref></char>), kɛlɛ é gaaɠaani ga tosu ɠa ná Egilisii naa letemazu. Kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ Epafelase ɠa é Kolɔse Egilisii laaɠulani, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni Kolɔse nu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nii é ɠɛni Pɔle yiiɓɔlɔzu, naa ɠɛni ga zɛɛ ɠalagiti ti ɠɛni wosu Kolɔse Egilisii zu. É ná-sɛʋɛi ɠilazu wola ɠɛɛʋɛ, é lo naa ʋa. Ɗa ka ga Egilisii naa zu, keletiɛin tanigaa ti ga Zuifuiti, naati ka ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti da zɔiti ma ga maaɓa ga ti ɠolo Zuifuiti ta-lɔgiti bɛ, niiti Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu, ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga tatipɛlɛʋolu vai. Pɔle sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛʋɛ ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛ, nii a kɛ é dɛɛ ga keletiɛinti kpɛdɛ nu ɠili nɔpɛ ba, ɓaa ani nɔpɛ ga GALA ge ʋa yeezei ti wu, kɛni Kilista ɠila kpe nɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:15-20">1:15-20</ref></char>), ta é dɛɛ ga kalagi niiti ti lɔɔɓadɔai nuɓusɛ ɠisiɛi nɔ ma, kulanuma la naati ba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 2:8">2:8</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pɔle sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ná-tuʋɔ gooi laazeeli Egilisii ma, é Kolɔse (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋolu é sɛʋɛi ɠɛ, é dɛɛ ʋelei Kilista wɔɔlɔai la, é naa ɠɛ ga gooɠaaʋotegi zɛɛ ɠalabogiti daalɔɠɔma Kolɔse (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 1:3-3:4">1:3—3:4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Eɠɛʋelei kɛɛ vaa wɔlɔmai la ná-sɛʋɛ mɔinmɔin su, Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelasuʋɛ ɠɛɛʋɛ ga é kala kɛzɛɠɛzɛ fe, é lo keletiɛn eteai ziɛ ʋelei ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 3:5-4:6">3:5—4:6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Pɔle gaaɓelagɛ ga tuʋɔ gooiti, ta é deveiti fe, nii a kɛ ti sɛʋɛi nii ɠala woo wola zu zɔɔma Egilisiiti su (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, nà ga Yesu Kilista ná-keelai, GALA ziimai maaʋele ma, gá ade-ɠɛɛloin Timɔte, <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>gá wo luʋɔsu, GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti, wɔi wo Kolɔse taazuʋɛ, gi-ɠɛɛleaiti gilibalai zu ada Kilista, wɔi wo ga wooɠɛɠila nuiti: Ade-Ɠɛɛ GALA ge zaalai la wo ma, é ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mama fee ƓALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Gá GALA mamasu ɠɔ, de-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista Kɛɛɠɛ ya, siɛgi zu gá ɠɛna GALA falia la wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Tama, gi wa-ɠidaaleʋe vai mɛnini Yesu Kilista ma, ta nɛɛbɛi é wo-yiimaʋɛ, é lo GALA ná-nuiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Naama ɠidaaleʋei ta ma nɛɛbɛi ʋilɛgɛ naa ʋa, nii é ga wa-ɠitogi GALA ge makɛsu wo ʋɛ geeɠɔlɔgi zu. Kitogi naa, wo kwɛni ga gaamai ma lɛnɛgi maaʋele, é woni wo ma, nii é ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi tɛi ge ʋaani wo ʋɔ bɛ. É ʋaani ga kulanumai, é li luɠɔ eteai zu ná pɛ, ʋelei é kɛai la wo zaama, kaite naama voloi, yeei mɔunpa wo GALA ná-zaalai ma wooi mɛnini da, wo tɔɔzei ga kwɛɛga, ʋelei é la ɠiteɠite. <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Gi-nɛɛɲɔɠɔi Epafelase, gi boti ɠilagi zu, naa ɠa é wo ɠalagai ga naa, toɠa wo ʋɛ ga Kilista ná-botiɠɛ nui, é ga wooɠɛɠila nui. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>É nɛɛbɛ vai wogɛ gi ma, nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai feai wo ʋɛ.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-GALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kaipa gi wo-maawooi mɛnini, gi la looɠosu GALA falii ʋa wo ʋɛ. Gá GALA falizu ga é wo laave ga ziimai ɠwɛɛgai ga ɠimalai maaʋele, ta keleɠelegi nii Zɛnvu Ɲadegai feezu. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Naazu, wa zoo wo ziɛ eɠɛʋelei Maliɠii pɔ la, wo ɗa naa ɠɛ yeenɔpɛ, nii nɛai bɛ. Wa gwaai wo ga kɛɛwoti ʋagɔi ma zii pɛ, wa li luɠɔma GALA kwɛɛgai zu. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>GALA ge wo zɛbɛlɔ fai pɛ su ga ná-zɛbɛi maanɛai, nii a kɛ wo ziɛ fai pɛ bu ga ziilɔɔi. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>À Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA mama ga koozunɛɛi. Tɔ ɠa é zobo fea wo ʋɛ, ga wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ poganiiti su, ti makɛgai wozakalagi ma masadai zu naati bɛ, ti ga ná-nuiti. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>É ade ɠulaa kpidii ná-zobogi ya, é li ga deye nɛɛbɛ Loun Zunui ná-masadai zu. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>De unmɔɔgi zɔlɔɔga ga tɔun maaʋele, é ade zuvaayɛ ga da-ɠotoiti.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilista ɠɛʋelei ta ná-botii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>GALAGI nu la kaazu, Kilista ɠa é ga naa maaniinigi. Tɔ ɠa é ga Doun Zunu Mɔungi, bɔɔlɔai kpɛtɛanii pɛ ba. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge aniiti kpein kpɛtɛni ga Kilista maaʋele, geeɠɔlɔgi zu, zooi ma, niiti nu a ti ɠa ga ɠaazu, ta niiti nu la ti ɠa ga ɠaazu, masadaiti, maliɠilaiti, kundiɠilaiti, zobodaiti. GALA ge anii pɛ kpɛtɛni saɓui zu, ta tɔun bɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Kaite toɠa ná aniiti pɛ tuɠɔ, ti pɛ ta ɠɛʋele ma tɔun saɓui zu. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>Egilisii é ga kpusɛi, tɔ ɠa é ga naa ma ungi. Tɔ ɠa é ga fai pɛ tɔɔzeigi, Doun Zunu Mɔungi, buzeɠeai, é ɠula saai ya, naa ɠa a kɛ é ɠɛ ga ma mɔungi fai pɛ su. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge deveni ga fai kpein daazeeliai, naa zei ziimaʋɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>Zenɔ ɠana, GALA ge deveni ga é ti yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ ta aniiti pɛ ga ná-Doun Zunui maaʋele, niiti ti eteai zu, ta niiti ti geeɠɔlɔgi zu. É ziilɛigi ɓɛtɛni ga ná-Doun Zunui ma ɲamai maaʋele, nii puai saa wului ma.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Wa ma, mɔungi wo maaɠoozani GALA ba, wo ɠɛni ga sili nuiti, tɔɔzei wo ɠɛni kisiɛ ɲɔiti bosu, wo ɗa faa ɲɔiti kɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Kɛlɛ é wo yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛa niizu ga saai maaʋele nii ná-Doun Zunui boga kpusɛi zu, ga é ʋa wo lo ɠaazu ɲadedai zu, kɔzɔzu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ wo ʋa, ta peelalazu nɔpɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, kɛni wo lo kpaan, wo zapelɔ kidaaleʋei zu. À mina ɲiikpi, wo ʋa maaɠooza wa-ɠitogi ʋa, nii wo mɛnini ga Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi maaʋele. Niima Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɠa ga naa, nii daazeelini kpɛtɛanii pɛ ma eteai zu. Nà Pɔle, gè ɠɛa ga ma wotiɠɛ nui.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲɛpii Pɔle kɔɔzu Egilisii ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Kòozu ɠa nɛɛzu niizu nà-kpɔlɔiti su wa-vaa zu. Nii daa la zeelini Kilista ná-kpɔlɔi vaa zu, gè naa laazeeli kpùsɛi zu, nɔnɔ ma ɓusɛi ʋɛ, nii é ga Egilisii. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Gè ɠɛa ga Egilisii ná-botiɠɛ nui, eɠɛʋelei naama losuʋɛ la GALA ge kalivaai mà wa-vaa zu. É tèʋeni ga gè daawooi laazeeli, ta mina yɛ ʋoluzu. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Daawooi nii é ga GALA ná-faazeikpasui ma lɔɔɠuzu vai é ɠɛa lɔɔɠuni nuɓusɛiti ba kaite wɔlɔwɔlɔ, kɛlɛ é ɠulaa kɛlɛma niizu ná-nuiti bɛ. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>GALA ge devea ga é dɛɛ ga tiye ga ʋelei naama lɔɔɠuzu vai maayikiai la gola zii ɠiligiti bɛ. Naama lɔɔɠuzu vai ɠa é ga: Kilista ɠɛ wo-yiimaʋɛ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">wo-yiimaʋɛ</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">wo zaama</char></note> lɛbiyai é ʋaazu, naa ma ɠitogi. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Gá Kilista ná-fai laazeelizu nui pɛ ma. Gá tɛnɛgi wosu, gi ɛsɛ pɛ kala ga ɠimalai pɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ ɛsɛ pɛ suzeeli ta-ɠilibalai zu ta Kilista. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛzu gè botii ɠɛɛzu, gè ɲɛpii ɠɔ ga Kilista ná-zɛbɛi, nii é botii ɠɛɛzu zìimaʋɛ ga gola.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Nà pɔ ga wo naa ɠwɛɛ, ɲɛpi wolai gè kɔɔzu wo ʋɛ, wa Laodisé nuiti, ta niiti ti la kwɛ̀ɛ kpusɛi zu. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Nà ɲɛpi ɠɔɔzu ti ʋɛ, ga ti iɲɔ ge lɔ, ti ɠili ʋa nɛɛbɛi zu, ti ladalai ma mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔ, nii keleɠele kitei feezu. Ta GALA ná-faazeikpasui ma lɔɔɠuzu vai ɠwɛɛ naazu, naa ɠa é ga Kilista ɓɔɠɔi. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Ɠimalai ta faaɠwɛgi ma naavoloi pɛ dɔɔɠuʋɛ tɔun zea.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Nà nii wosu wo ma ga nu nɔpɛ ge mina wo ɠaka ga ná-kpɔɛzuɠula ʋagɔiti. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ anɛɛ ni kpùsɛi la miná wo zaama, kɛlɛ nà wo ʋa kisiɛi zu, ta toɠa bɛ̀ ga koozunɛ, gè faazeikpasu ʋagɔi ɠa é ɠɛɛzu wo zaama, ta ʋelei wo loni la kpaan wa-ɠidaaleʋei zu Kilista ma.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fai pɛ daazeeli vai ade ʋɛ, <optbreak/> Kilista zaɓui zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tɔɔzei wo yeezeiɗa Yesu Kilista wu ga wo-Maliɠii, wo-ziɛ ʋelei dɛɛ ga wo ɠiliʋɛ ba. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>À zapelɔ, wo lo kpaan wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Kilista, wo zɛbɛlɔ kidaaleʋei zu, eɠɛʋelei kalagiti ti la wo ti zɔlɔɔni. À yɛ GALA mamasu ɓalaa yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>À dama, nu nɔpɛ ge mina wo lɔ duɔlai zu ga ná-ɠima ɓɔɛ ɲakaiti, ti ga nu ɠaka saɓui, ti ɠulazu nuiti ta-vaa wɔlɔmaiti su, ta eteai zu yɛnvuiti su, ti la zolooni Kilista ná-faiti ma. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Mazɔlɔɔ galadai laazeeliaiti pɛ seiʋɛ Kilista ɓusɛi zu. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Fai pɛ daazeeliʋɛ wo ʋɛ tɔun saɓui zu. Tɔ ɠa é ga zobodaiti ta kundiɠilaiti ma ungi.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Kilista, wo latigɛ pɛlɛʋolu. Tatipɛlɛʋolui naa la ga nii nuiti ti kɛai ga yeei, kɛlɛ toɠa ga tatipɛlɛʋolui nii é zeɠezu Kilista ʋɔ bɛ, é nu unmɔɔsu, é kula kotoba ɓusɛi ná-zɛbɛi ya. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Wo maaɠuluʋɛ ʋɔɔma wa Kilista ga ɓatizei maaʋele, wo wuzeɠe ɓalaa ʋɔɔma, wo ɠula saai ya, tɔɔzei wo laani GALA ná-zɛbɛi la, nii é buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Wɔi wo zaa ɠɛni de zɛnvu zu vaiti tetemazu, wa-vaaɠaazagiti maaʋele ma, tɔɔzei wo ɠɛni ga tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti kpusɛi zu. Kɛlɛ niizu GALA ge wo vulua su ʋolu ʋɔɔma wa Kilista. GALA ge ade zuvaayɛga ga da-vaaɠaazagiti pɛ. <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ de maalɔ zɛʋɛi, é ɠɛni ade laalɔɠɔma, é ɠɛni dɛɛzu ga ada ɠa de la deveiti sosu, é naa ɠaaʋaani, é koloɠolo, é kpadɔ saa wului ma. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>GALA ge kundiɠilai ta zobodaiti suvikɛi ɠulani zɛnvuiti zea, é zɔngɔ zɛlɛ ti ʋa eteai pɛ gaazu, é pilɛ sɔlɔɔ ti ma ga Kilista maaʋele.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à mina va bu, nu nɔpɛ ge ʋa wo ʋeelala naama vaa zu, nii wa mi, ɓaa nii wa kpɔle, ɓaa fɛti vaa zu, ɓaa alu niinɛ vaa zu, ɓaa dooɠo folo vaa zu. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Naati pɛ ti ɠɛni nɔ ga niiti ti ʋaazu ti-maaniinigi, kɛlɛ ma ɠitei ɠa ga Kilista nɔ. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>À mina va bu, nu nɔpɛ ge ʋa wo ʋeelala, nii ziimai ga zɛɛ ɓɔɠɔmaayeii, ta geezuɠeelaiti dɛbi vaiti. Ti ɠilizu ta-ɠulakɛlɛmaiti nɔ ʋa, ti laavegai ga wasogi wafuun, ga kpusɛ zu ɠisiɛiti maaʋele. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Ta ɠɛlɛzu ga ti mina ɠili Kilista ʋa, nii é ga ma ungi. Tɔun saɓu zu ɠa kpusɛi kpein ge ɠɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔsu da, giliai ɓɔɠɔ ʋa ga todazuʋɛti ta pɛɛpɛɛbazuʋɛti maaʋele, é ɗa wɔɔlɔ eɠɛʋelei GALA ge pɔ la.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wo za ta wo yɛnvu ʋɔɔma wa Kilista</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Wo zaani ʋɔɔma wa Kilista, eteai zu yɛnvuiti ti la mɔ ga ani nɔpɛ wo letema. Leeni vaa zu mu wo wa-eteai ziɛzu eɠɛ wa ɠɛ ga eteai nɔnɔ? Leeni vaa zu wo vaazu bu, ti ɗa naama leve ziiti da wo ma: <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>«Mina nii zeɠe! Mina naa ɠɔɠɔ! Mina yeevɔɔɠu nuu ʋa!»? <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Naama aniiti kpein ti la ɠoloɠolosu ɓaa, botii ɠɛa ʋoluma ga tiye? Naama leveiti ta ga nuɓusɛiti ta-leveiti nɔ, ta ta-ɠalagiti. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Gaamazu, naama leveiti ta ɠɛɛzu eɠɛ ɠima vaa, ɓɔɠɔyiima ɠala dɛbii, zɛɛ ɓɔɠɔmaayeii, tɔgi ti seizu ɓɔɠɔ ma, ga ti ti-ɓusɛi ɓɔlɔ gola, kɛlɛ tosu nɔpɛ ge la ti ʋa, ga de ʋa vɔni kpusɛi yiimaiti ma la.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Kɛlɛ wo wuzeɠeni, wo ɠula saai ya wa Kilista. Deɠɛmu, à geezuʋɛ vaiti gaiziɛ, ʋɛ Kilista zeini ná, GALA zeezazuʋɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Wa-ɠigaiziɛi pɛ ge lo geezuʋɛ vaiti ba, é mina mɔ li ga etea geleiti pɔ pelei. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo zaani, wo-yɛnvui ʋɛɛ Kilista ʋa, ti lɔɔɠu GALA zea. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Siɛgi zu Kilista, é ga wo-yɛnvui, é ɠulazu la kɛlɛma, wa ɓalaagi wa ɠula kɛlɛma wa tɔun, wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ ná-lɛbiyai zu.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvu wɔlɔmai ta zɛnvu niinɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Deɠɛmu, à etea vaa ɲɔiti suɠoloɠolo, ti wo-yiimaʋɛ: koloɠologi, kɔzɔba vai, ɓɔɠɔyiimai, ani wɔin ɲɔu vaiti, ta koozu yii, é ga kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Naama ziɛ ʋeleiti ka ti GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai maalolisu naati ma, niiti ti la kɛɛzu ti ʋa gooi zo. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Wo ɠɛni ziɛzu ɠana mɔungi zu, siɛgi zu wo ɠɛni eteai ziɛzu la naama ɠotoiti su. <verse eid="COL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Kɛlɛ niizu, à ɠɛlɛ niima vaiti pɛ ba: ziiɠaawanai, ziiɠulagi, keleɠele ɲɔi, tɔɠɔ ɠoloɠologi, ta woo ɲɔu wo faiti ti ɠulazu wo-laaʋɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>À mina ɗa ga zɛɛ wo ɓɔɠɔ ma mɔnɔ, mazɔlɔɔ wo nu wɔlɔmalai ta ma ziɛ ʋelei ɠulaa ɠɔba. <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>Wo ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilia ga nu niinɛlai, nii é niinɛzu, é zoloo Kpɛtɛ ƓALAGI ma niinigi ma, nii a kɛ wo kwɛɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu nɔpɛ ge la Zuifuiti ba ta nuiti ti la ga Zuifua, ɓaa tatipɛlɛʋolu nuiti ta tatipɛlɛʋolulala nuiti, ɓaa dɔɓɔzu nuiti, ɓaa kalatala nuiti, ɓaa duɔiti ta wɔɔlɔiti, kɛlɛ Kilista ɠa é ga ma ɓiigi fai pɛ su.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, tɛi wo ga nu ɲadegaiti, GALA ge wo nɛai ʋɛ, é yiimazeɠe ga woye ga wo ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ, à ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga niima vaiti: maawɔinɠai, nuɓɔɠɔlai, ɓɔɠɔmaayeii, sɛsɛbogi, ta ziilɔɔi. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>À yeezei ɓɔɠɔ wu wo ɠilagilagi pɛ. Ni ta-zɔ ka bɔɔla ɠisu, à ɓɔɠɔ zuvaayɛ. Eɠɛʋelei Maliɠii wo zuvaayɛgai da, wa ɓalaagi, wo maanɛɛʋɛ wo zɔiti suvaayɛ ɠana. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Kɛlɛ nii bɔɔlɔai ti pɛ ba, à ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga nɛɛbɛi, nii é wo ɠilizu ɓɔɠɔ ʋa kpaan. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Kilista ná-ziilɛigi lo wo luɠɔ, naama yiilɛigi ɠa GALA ge wo loligai ma ʋɔɔma, wo ɠɛ ga kpusɛ ɠilagi ʋaalobazuʋɛti. À ɠɛ ga faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛ nuiti. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Kilista laawooi yɛ wo zaama ga bɔɔlɔa. À ɓɔɠɔ ɠala, wo ɓɔɠɔ lɛnɛ wo ɠilagilagi ɠimalai pɛ su. À GALA guyeiti too, ta GALA dɛbi wuyeiti, naa ʋɛɛ guyeiti ba Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ti lɛɛzu ga woye. À ti loo GALA bɛ ga yii pɛ ta faanɛɛ wuuɠwɛɛgai. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Nii nɔpɛ wo kɛɛzu, kpɔɛzuɠulai zu ɓaa kɛɛwotii zu, à ti pɛ kɛ, é zoloo Maliɠii Yesu yiimai ma, wo ɗa Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA mama ga tɔun maaʋele.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA nui ná-pɛlɛyeɠei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Anzaiti, à ɓɔɠɔmaayei wo-zinigiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei soloogai da anzanuiti ma, niiti ti ga Maliɠii nɔnɔiti. <verse eid="COL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Anzazinigiti, à wo-anzaiti nɛɛ ʋɛ, à mina ti zopele ɲɔu. <verse eid="COL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Dointi, à ɠolo fai pɛ su wo zɔlɔɔ nuiti bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ Maliɠii yiimai ɠana. <verse eid="COL 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Doun kɛɛɠɛiti, à mina wo-lointi ziiɓɔlɔ vaa ɠɛ, wo ʋa ti iɲɔteʋe.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Duɔiti ta duɔ kɛɛɠɛiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Duɔiti, à ɠolo fai pɛ su wa-luɔ kɛɛɠɛiti bɛ eteai zu, naa mina ɠɛ ga ti ɠaazu vaa nɔ, wo ʋa nu ɛnɛkɛ nɔ, kɛlɛ à kɛ ga zii zɔledai, unfemai maaʋele ma wo feezu Maliɠii ʋɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Boti nɔpɛ wo kɛɛzu, à kɛ ga wo-yiimaʋɛ pɛ, eɠɛʋelei wo kɛɛzu la Maliɠii ʋɛ, nuiti taade wo ʋa ɠɛ kɛɛzu ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>À suɠwɛɛ ga Maliɠii ɠa wa-ɠulanumai ve wo ya, wo wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ poganiiti su. Kilista ɠa é ga Maliɠii nii wo botii ɠɛɛzu bɛ. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ zɔi nɔpɛ é telebotalai ɠɛɛzu, toɠa naama zalai zɔlɔɔ nii soloogai telebotalai ma nii é kɛai. GALA ge la ɗa ga zeelɔzɔɠɔzu ɠɛ nuɓusɛiti su.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Duɔ kɛɛɠɛiti, à wa-luɔiti sopele ɓɛtɛ, é zoloo telebodai ta sɔledai ma, wo ɠɛ suɠwɛɛ ga wa ɓalaagi wo-Maliɠii ɠa geeɠɔlɔgi zu.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛnɛ gaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>À yiilɔɔ GALA falii wu, wo ɠaaɓa ma, naa ʋɛɛ mamagi ʋa. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>À GALA fali gá ɓalaa gi ʋɛ, GALA ge pele laalao gi luɠɔ daawooi wo fai zu, naa ɠa a kɛ gi zoo gi Kilista ná-dɔɔɠuzu vai laazeeli. Naa maaʋele ɠa gè ɠɛa la ga kasoɠa nu. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>À GALA fali ga gè wooi naa lɛ, é ɠole, eɠɛʋelei maanɛai gè kɛ la.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>À ziɛ ga ɠimalai kamaʋolu nuiti bɛ. À mina yeeɠɛɠalai ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Woo nɛɛnɛgiti ti ɠɛ wo la yeenɔpɛ, nii a nu ɛnɛkɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo kwɛɛ ʋelei wa zoo nuiti gooɠaaʋotesu la.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gaaɓelagiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Gi-ɠɛɛloin, gi-nɛɛɲɔɠɔi Tisike, é Maliɠii ná-botii ɠɛɛzu wooɠɛɠiladai zu, gi botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma ga tɔ Maliɠii ʋɛ, naa ɠa nà-faiti pɛ bo wo ma. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Nà teʋesu wo ma, naama vai nɔ ma, naa ɠa a kɛ wo gá-vaiti kwɛɛ, é wo iɲɔdɔ ga pagɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Nà ti leʋesu ta gi-ɠɛɛloin, gi-nɛɛɲɔɠɔi Wonezime, é ga wooɠɛɠila nui, nii é ga wo ta. Ta naati pɛ bo wo ma, niiti ti leʋegai ʋɛ.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Alisitaake ɠa wo luʋɔsu, gá nii gi kasoi ɠa ʋɔɔma. Ɓalanaɓase kɛkɛ loin Maleke ɓalaa ɠa wo luʋɔsu. Kaite gè deveiti feeni wo ya ná-faa zu. Ni a ʋaana wo ʋɔ bɛ, à yeezei bu ga pagɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Yesu, nii daasei pɛai ga Zusetuse, naa ɓalaa ɠa wo luʋɔsu. Naama zunu saʋagɔiti nɔ ɠa ti ga Zuifuiti ti bà, gi botii ɠɛɛzu ʋɔɔma GALA ná-masadai vaa ma, ta ìɲɔdɔɔzu gola. <verse eid="COL 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Epafelase ɓalaa ɠa wo luʋɔsu, toɠa ga wo ta. Yesu Kilista ná-botiɠɛ nui naa la looɠosu GALA falii ʋa wo ʋɛ, nii a kɛ wo lo kpaan, wo ɠɛ ga nu ɠiteiti kidaaleʋei zu, ti laai GALA ziima vai pɛ da. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>Nà niima zeele wooi wosu bɛ, ga toɠa ɓɔlɔzu gola wo ʋɛ, ta niiti ti Laodisé, ta niiti ti Yielapolise. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Luke, ɗɔɠɔtɔlɔi, gi-nɛɛɲɔɠɔi, ta Demase ta wo luʋɔsu ɓalaa.<verse eid="COL 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>À ade-ɠɛɛleaiti tuʋɔ gi ʋɛ, niiti ti Laodisé, wo Nimefa luʋɔ, ta Egilisii é ɠaalɛɛzu ba ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Niima zɛʋɛi ɠalagai ma wo ʋɔ bɛ, à teʋe, é ɠala Egilisii zu Laodisé nuiti pɔ bɛ. Wa ɓalaagi wo naama zɛʋɛi ɠala, nii gè teʋeni Laodisé nuiti pɔ. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>À bo Aalisipe ma, ga é ɠaaɓa é botii naa ɓe ga pagɔ, nii é sɔlɔɔgai Maliɠii ya.<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Nà Pɔle, nà ɓɔɠɔi zèeʋogi ɠa gè wo luʋɔsu da. À mina yeema ga nà kasoi ɠa. GALA ná-zaalai yɛ wo ʋa!<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
